    "description": "A safety boundary. Three claims must survive translation: reverse-engineered candidates rather than manufacturer documentation; a read-only query can still wake a controller; a decoded number can look plausible and not apply."
  },
  "settingsBatteryLabEvidenceAck": "I understand that the source data and the synthetic tests do not prove this applies to my own vehicle",
